msgid "Continuing a Mission After Landing"
msgstr "降落后继续执行任务"

#: ../../source/docs/common-continue-mission.rst:7
#: 08ac5979c3054611a01293a10a9732a3 84fa9424215f481faa8fbd84c5807412
#: 8c782e3f15384ecfbf7a744ff8da5082 a5c96e264a2d4286ac771f3a833e5002
#: c7e82287148a4ea39d6b8a5afd392ca6 d5886030cfcb42eea9fe49d38464f06b
msgid ""
"This video shows how to setup a mission in which a landing occurs, disarms, "
"waits, re-arms and then re-takeoff and continue the mission."
msgstr "此视频展示如何设置一个任务：先降落，上锁，等待，再解锁，然后重新起飞并继续执行任务。"

#: ../../source/docs/common-continue-mission.rst:13
#: 3c143da6e001480e8eb1653f06dcd9d1 848d1c812a774d16bd4711675690411a
#: 870fe7ed782c460298cb319b4a9f576a a67f33a2f08a4b729d45ed06d615a02c
#: c73b38c0d3204dc999712738a6e2fead c9fcec15df274e2eb971d15d1a8530c5
msgid ""
"in the above video, since the vehicle is disarmed at the first landing point"
" and then re-armed, home is reset to that first landing point. Any "
"subsequent RTL will be to that newly set \"home\" unless the mission uses a "
"``DO_SET_HOME`` mission command to change it."
msgstr ""
"在上述视频中，由于飞行器在第一个降落点上锁后再解锁，Home 位置将重置为该第一个降落点。任何后续的 RTL "
"都将返回到这个新设定的「Home」，除非任务中使用 ``DO_SET_HOME`` 任务指令来更改它。"
